      "delete_workflow_instance": false,
      "description": "**Audit Organization Settings with Pagination**\n\nAudits security and authentication settings across all accessible Cisco Meraki organizations. Uses pagination for large environments and parallel processing for speed.\n\n**Expected Output:** \nA structured JSON array detailing each organization's security posture, including:\n* API \u0026 SAML SSO status.\n* Password policies (expiration, strength, reuse).\n* Access controls (lockouts, idle timeouts, 2FA).\n* IP restrictions for logins and API keys.\n\n**Prerequisites:** Meraki API Key with at least Read-Only access.\n**Target:** Meraki Endpoint.",
      "display_name": "Audit Organization Settings with Pagination",
      "runtime_user": {
        "override_target_runtime_user": false,
        "specify_on_workflow_start": false,
        "target_default": true
      },
      "target": {
        "target_type": "meraki.endpoint",
        "specify_on_workflow_start": true
      }
